{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"70efbbc8770851b0524b8f57fd0c4d51bf4fdd5f27997a81c5e4e1054f57d0e2","ja":"プレゼントの候補がいっぱい","zh":"好多候选礼物","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"48a620922c8e385946107157662ab7bffa7024d15b43e94c9bb5507c475e8f3b","ja":"あ、ネクタイフェアやってるよ。\nかわいいのとか、かっこいいのとか、たくさんあるね♪","zh":"啊，正在举办领带展销会呢。\n可爱的、帅气的，有好多款式呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"369b0df41c9fd2f98c10b23d0a0286cd0634848253ec281d5fefc7399bacb3e2","ja":"はい！　こっちの青いネクタイ、パパに似合いそう……\nあ、でも、こっちのグレーのもいいかも。","zh":"好的！这条蓝色的领带，感觉挺适合爸爸的……\n啊，不过，这条灰色的好像也不错。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c06094d0d2cdfb9c56f9edb3f2eeb6520c7def3cf92c55669aa98240048e0443","ja":"うう……たくさんありすぎて、迷っちゃいます。\nどれが喜んでもらえそうかな……？","zh":"呜呜……太多了，真让人拿不定主意。\n选哪一个大家会高兴呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3e44d34e6f0c4bedc0b686300b6ff1d59b2e152bcb5f7a18c9949b7c0c467d6c","ja":"プレゼント選びって難しいよね。せっかくだから、\nネクタイ以外も見てみよっか？　ゆっくり考えよう♪","zh":"挑选礼物还挺难的呢。难得来一次，\n要不要也看看领带以外的东西？慢慢考虑吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"5c4122b6f14fd09097760dcb7fab9c2d1a7e8947c25b18ae4b3b690d19daaafa","ja":"この名刺入れ。かっこいいですね♪\nパパがお仕事で使ってくれるかも。","zh":"这个名片夹很帅气呢♪\n说不定爸爸工作时能用得上。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"15ba5910e69ff18191a6f25870d423fbedf25ed2aa3e6be6ddc494da90b0df51","ja":"名前の刻印もしてくれるみたいだよ！\nその人のためだけの名刺入れが作れるんだって。","zh":"好像还能帮忙刻上名字呢！\n说是可以做出专属于那个人的名片夹哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2bfef53bc3355a217f7dcec34d7b4c74364fc845b2c8f1266b21031173eee19c","ja":"わあ、ステキです♪　そういえばネクタイピンも、\n名前を入れられるって言ってましたね。","zh":"哇，真不错呢♪　说起来领带夹也是，\n之前说过可以刻上名字呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"5ae48f4c4f1d02ef372ac462085982d55c286de7cafe1150c9ed15df9f18d1f2","ja":"名前が入ってると、特別感があるよね。\nプレゼントにぴったり！","zh":"印有名字的话，就很有特别感呢。\n非常适合拿来送礼！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9f73b52776960009233389716737ed40efca16807b86351b03efdb02f28653aa","ja":"はい！　でも、他にもステキな物がたくさんで、\n迷っちゃいます。うーん、うーん……。","zh":"好的！不过，其他很棒的东西也好多，\n真让人纠结。嗯——，嗯——……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"ed0748606ac2c315671726b3662e91e74bd535127f7badb002c14428bb869b93","ja":"パパに似合うものをあげたいんですけど、\nパパが自分じゃ選びそうにないのもいいかも……あっ！","zh":"虽然想送适合爸爸的东西，\n但送爸爸自己可能不会选的好像也不错……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c83edf49ea8e4439def497c31b13f852c0f8446e9eff0611452fef8bec69df98","ja":"あっちのお店で、純金で小物が作れるみたいですよ！\nパパは、きっとああいうのも似合うと思います！","zh":"那边的店里好像可以用纯金做小物件呢！\n我觉得爸爸戴那种也一定会很合适！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"370e3c3b19231934f28fa527d14f48a47e6e3169276f9e5bd15800d882ed79bf","ja":"あ、でもあのこぐまのお人形もいいですよね！\nこれだったら、パパは自分じゃ選ばないから……。","zh":"啊，不过那只小熊玩偶也很不错呢！\n要是这个的话，爸爸自己肯定不会选……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"e46aee526630e0f39968d7a76df061edb7c29bed374d379a05835a1edf943eb2","ja":"純金とか、こぐまのぬいぐるみって……\nちょ、ちょっと待って、星梨花ちゃん！","zh":"纯金，还有小熊玩偶什么的……\n等等，等一下，星梨花！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"4ad98d515287d7af0feccfef7408aa1d3f17eb56677a05bd0f1649e2f31bb1e6","ja":"うう……決められません……。あっ、だったら、\n全部買って、パパに選んでもらったら……。","zh":"呜呜……选不出来……啊，既然这样，\n要是全买回去，让爸爸帮我选的话……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"1153a26ec5f418cf00dde4552f4b81c4a19622a61115fb15bab330dbac59d2e5","ja":"ええっと……一生懸命なのは\nいいけど、ちょっと思いつめすぎかなって……。","zh":"那个……努力是件好事，\n但感觉你有点钻牛角尖了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"16ece8856309565d38785d690312c84e2fabb6c9065503ce69f29cd60b605714","ja":"どうしたら……うう……\n…………ピーーーーーーーーッ。","zh":"该怎么办才好……呜呜……\n…………哔————————。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1760.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"0a34e108a10a5478efa9e42f2b9630ebe02685d157a9689f8af41e28901d4755","ja":"わーっ、星梨花ちゃん！　い、一旦、休憩しよ！\n落ち着いて考え直した方がいいから！　ねっ！","zh":"哇啊，星梨花！先、先休息一下吧！\n还是先冷静下来重新考虑比较好！好不好嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
